OL,3,GNEWSA'We thought we'd faint', musicians
OL,4,Areflect on heatwave
OL,5,
OL,6,FMusicians say high temperatures over
OL,7,Fthe summer left them struggling during
OL,8,Fperformances, with some singers saying
OL,9,Fthey felt close to fainting at gigs.
OL,11,FSummer 2026 was the UK's hottest on
OL,12,Frecord, according to provisional data
OL,13,Ffrom the Met Office. Americana cousin
OL,14,Fduo Chloe Payne, 29, and Amie Parsons,
OL,15,F32, from Cornwall band True Foxes said
OL,16,Fit was the first year they needed
OL,17,Fcooling fans on the stage.
OL,19,F"There's been a couple of shows where
OL,20,Fwe both felt like we were going to
OL,21,Ffaint mid show," Payne said.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
