OL,3,GNEWSA'We thought we'd faint', musicians
OL,4,Areflect on heatwave
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnother musician, Rhys Hurd, said the
OL,7,Fheat led to problems with his
OL,8,Fequipment, including seven guitar
OL,9,Fstrings snapping, while he also needed
OL,10,Fto reapply sun cream during outdoor
OL,11,Fperformances.
